🍔 Foody — Full Stack Food Ordering App

Foody is a full-stack food delivery web application where users can browse a menu, add items to their cart, place orders with secure online payments, and track their order status. It also includes an admin panel for managing the food catalog and order fulfillment.

🔗 Live Demo

  **Customer Website: "https://foodygo.onrender.com"
  **Admin Panel: "https://foody-admin-s07c.onrender.com"
  **Backend API: "https://foody-backend-o94t.onrender.com"
⚠️ Hosted on Render's free tier — the backend may take 30–60 seconds to spin up on the first request after a period of inactivity.

✨ Features

🍕 Browse food items by category with live data from MongoDB
🛒 Add to cart, update quantities, and view order totals
🔐 User authentication (signup/login with JWT)
💳 Secure checkout with Razorpay payment integration
📦 Order history and real-time order status tracking
🛠️ Admin panel to add, remove, and manage food items
📋 Admin order management with status updates

Tech Stack

** Frontend
  React (Vite)
  React Router
  Axios
  CSS

** Backend
  Node.js + Express
  MongoDB Atlas + Mongoose
  JWT Authentication
  Razorpay Payment Gateway

** Deployment
   Render (Static Site for frontend/admin, Web Service for backend)

